# Tor configuration for mempool frontend hidden service
SocksPort 0
ControlPort 9051
CookieAuthentication 1
CookieAuthFile /var/lib/tor/control_auth_cookie
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
Log notice stdout
SafeLogging 1
CircuitBuildTimeout 10
NewCircuitPeriod 30
MaxCircuitDirtiness 600
EnforceDistinctSubnets 0

# Hidden service for the Mempool web UI
HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/mempool_hidden_service
HiddenServicePort 80 127.0.0.1:8080
